{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_07",
  "title": "生活之道",
  "storyCode": "IC-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b9eaa7b4f7829faa961b046d7a98cecee7e6dac796d978899020aa159956cc73",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g11_malistgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位际崖城的居民，你们好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶奇大师的勘测结果已经出炉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活性源石矿脉的爆发时间，大约在二十五天后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从现在开始，际崖城将正式进入撤离的准备阶段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来，经过各位代表的讨论后，将在合适的时间于广场举行一场全体会议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "届时，我们将讨论具体的撤离方案，以及城市的遗容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请各位际崖城居民注意收听广播。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯绮，醒醒，黛柯绮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睡着的黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......机器人斯第奇，真听话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......黛柯绮，黛柯绮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睡着的黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "机器人卡奇，笨笨的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睡着的黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们，打一架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底在做什么梦啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯绮！醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我还想问你呢，你怎么又在斯第奇的花园里午睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为斯第奇的花园很安静啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你睡得这么死，肯定也没听到广播吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生什么事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......耶奇大师去湖对岸勘测过后，发现了源石矿脉被之前的地震拉扯到了隧道出口的附近，而且活性化已经十分厉害了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们接下来要开一次全体会议，决定如何避难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你应该不是特意来告诉我这个的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是来找斯第奇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯第奇的话，他应该乘坐我借给他的船去湖对岸找耶奇大师他们去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗，那我在这里等他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你找他有事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我希望，他......能回到设计部来参与穹顶的设计修改。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然际崖城面临毁灭，我们关于这座城市地标的比拼已经毫无意义，但好在我们还有些时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，我们在之后的大会上肯定需要决定，该如何处理地震留下的穹顶缺口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就那么放着不管我觉得也可以吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使如此，那也要城里的居民们都同意才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让一座城市在这片土地上存在的最后一瞬间趋于完美，这对于每个建筑设计师来说都是非常有意义的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会对这座城市进行最后一次观察，并且给出一个在有限的时间里能够完成的方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你希望斯第奇能够回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道芬奇大师为什么会忽然离开，别人或许会以为，是因为他们师徒的感情淡了，或者缘分尽了，但我知道，这是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为芬奇大师过去的助手，我比任何人都了解，他虽然是个十分豪放的人，但心底里其实非常关心斯第奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对他来说，斯第奇就像他的亲生儿子一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，他的离开一定和斯第奇有密不可分的关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而斯第奇在大师离开后的情况，身为工业代表你也看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他从一次次提出的方案被否决，到逐渐不再在设计部出现，在这中间，我一直想要帮他，却始终没有找到办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这座穹顶，是斯第奇的老师，芬奇大师留给这座城市最宏伟的作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这座穹顶，对斯第奇来说，会不会反而是一种负担呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使如此，你也不希望他留下遗憾，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是最后的机会了，黛柯绮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有你的风格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯第奇，斯第奇！你在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？怎么是你们两个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡奇，原来你和黛柯绮是这种关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，好果断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就别拿我开玩笑了，极境哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶奇大师，嘉维尔小姐，你们辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这里午睡，他在这里等斯第奇回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯第奇没有回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不是应该给大师你们送设备去了吗？还闹出了不小的动静呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他中途就不见了，我们都不知道他去哪了，结果他也没有回家吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米遇到过这小子，说他的表情好像很难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们有什么头绪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可能知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g5_library_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖玛玛，祖玛玛，这一列，也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，看看下一列吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，我有些累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然到现在都没找到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你休息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于刚才的问题，我还是想知道为什么，祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会没有发现在杜林城邦的生活有多么美好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里没有贵族阴谋，没有勾心斗角——即使有，也都是可爱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是我们即将面临的灾难，杜林对其也有足够的预案，他们现在甚至能够悠闲地思考——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何让际崖城以他们认为最好的姿态迎接毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没有否定你的想法啊，阿芙朵嘉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得你说的挺对的，杜林的生活挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拒绝你的理由不是觉得你说的这些不好，而是......我不喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是到时候有提亚卡乌愿意来地下生活的话，我想，我也好，依娜姆也好，都不会阻止的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？我并不是单单因为自身的经历而排斥地面的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在杜林城邦的这段日子里，我思考过许多次这样的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我认为，从结果上来说，杜林人过的生活无疑是一种更好的，更有人文追求的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但为什么你也好，嘉维尔也好，都对于一种更好的生活不感兴趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的师父除了对于机械知识非常精通之外，也是个影视迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她经常会拉着我看各种各样的东西，并且根本不管我感不感兴趣就给我讲解，久而久之，我也记住了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如，她在看到剧中人开始长篇大论的时候，总是会说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“唉，这种义正词严地长篇大论的人，一般最后要么是反派，要么是主角的绊脚石，就不能设计点可爱的角色吗......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你一定要说服我，或者说服嘉维尔呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，顺便一提，小姑娘，关于杜林，你的看法实际上并不正确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你说，在杜林城邦的生活是一种“更便捷”“更舒适”“更安全”之类的生活，我都不会反驳你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你认为，杜林人过的生活是一种“更好的”生活，只有这一点，或许并不是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是个聪明的孩子，不会不了解这其中的差别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生......我暂且这么称呼您，我明白您的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，难道说，我希望其他人过上物质上和精神上都更加富足的生活是错的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是另一个问题，现在的你，只是希望从一场早已结束的辩论中挽回自己的一点颜面，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g8_malistroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，你觉得斯第奇因为心理压力太大，所以选择了逃避？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是这样的话，我想，他现在可能去了湖边的一座小房子里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他搬到这栋房子来之前，那里是他和他的老师一起生活的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡奇，你明白我想说什么吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果最后决定要修改穹顶设计，而斯第奇还是不愿意的话，由我来，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不仅仅是为了城市的遗容，从现实的角度来说，穹顶的加固也能为我们的撤离争取更多的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和芬奇是好朋友，对于他的不告而别我也搞不懂，所以之前，我也想着尽量照看一下他的弟子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但凡事都有个界限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘉维尔小姐，能麻烦你去找一找斯第奇吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用你说，我也正打算去呢，特米米自告奋勇去帮城里的人做事了，我正愁没事干呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在看来，我和他之间可能有笔小账要算呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就拜托你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那栋房子在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在湖边，和这栋房子的风格很像，很独特，过去就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡奇，你不去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不知道在这种情况下，应该怎么面对斯第奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你很关心他，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在芬奇大师不告而别后，我一直想要帮助他，却不知道该怎么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊，该说你是人太好了呢，还是人太太太好了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你们杜林人确实整体上给我的感觉是这样没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出于我也不知道的原因，斯第奇其实是比较自卑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对他这种性格的人来说，你以你认为平等的态度去和他交流，在他看来，其实就是一种高姿态的施压。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为对他来说，光是伪装出自己和你平等的态度就已经竭尽全力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与人交流不是付出一片真心就一定能够有回报的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，我该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你喊我一声极境哥，那我这个做哥哥的，自然也要给你支两招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实很简单，你不要去说什么我希望你和我公平竞争，不要跟他说，你有选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要封住他的退路，告诉他，你没得选，但我会和你一起努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于把自己关在自己制造的小空间里太久的人，有的时候，是需要一些刺激的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯绮小姐觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么要问我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是说了一些我的猜测，而你，显然是在场的人中最了解他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斯第奇他确实是有些自卑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许你说得确实没错吧，他需要的不是温柔的安慰，而是有人狠狠地拉他一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样，不会伤到他吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会，而且不一定会有好的效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如果如你所说，这是他最后的机会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要问问你自己，你究竟只是想要和他关系变好，还是说，即使关系恶化，你也希望他走出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会去试试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我建议你快一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然的话，嘉维尔的拳头，可就不是“拉一把”那么简单了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·叙光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那我就先去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g11_malistgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活泼，外向，懂得社交，这些确实都是很好的品质，卡奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你认为人应该变成这样，而你也确实是在这么做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你不能总是想要让别人变得和你一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "极境的话也是对的，如果我要帮斯第奇的话，或许我也会这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我觉得苦恼和逃避也是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡奇，既然你要按照你的想法去做，那我也要按照我的想法去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果斯第奇想要逃，我会帮他逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯绮，黛柯绮，你找我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯绮·银币",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，去帮斯第奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g8_malistroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......黛柯绮小姐，如果她不是故意的，那就是她并没有发现自己的表情其实很好读懂吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她其实并不同意我的话，呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——好久没有感到这么青春的氛围了，我都有点想去凑热闹啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，真过去的话，说不定会被嘉维尔卷进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不想平白无故挨一顿揍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，斯第奇啊，你也该醒一醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有这么多人都想要帮你呢，视而不见可是会遭报应的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g5_library_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白，你们明明不像嘉维尔那样不讲道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你们会这么地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惯着她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为看到嘉维尔这样的人，你难道不觉得，我们需要这样的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依娜姆，你不是在外面吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你们半天不出来，还以为你们在干什么呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿芙朵嘉，其实我们是有些相似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会来阿卡胡拉当信使，很大一部分原因，其实是想要逃避无止境的王酋之间的倾轧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿卡胡拉什么都没有，但是在这里的生活很舒服，我很喜欢这片土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，要说担心，我比你更担心杜林的到来会不会引发什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你为什么还......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔离开了阿卡胡拉这么多年，一点也没有改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仿佛这片大地上没有什么东西能够让她屈服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到嘉维尔，我就会想，啊，这片大地上还是有这样的人的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会忍不住地想要帮她一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在跟着嘉维尔离开阿卡胡拉前，我也十分无知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟着罗德岛看到了许多东西，但我逐渐发现，我真正学到的，并不只是知识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这片大地上有着许多我没有想过，但又理所当然的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔一定也已经见过许多她也无能为力的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的梦想是造出这片大地上最厉害的机器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但造出来之后该用来做什么呢，我其实也没有想好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，看着嘉维尔，我逐渐有了一个想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我制造的机器，会用来帮助嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总有一天，嘉维尔的拳头会遇到砸不穿的墙壁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那并不是她的问题，她毕竟也是血肉之躯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我会像这一次一样，给她最好的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拳头不行，那就用斧头。斧头不行，那就用锤子。锤子不行，那就用电钻。电钻不行，那我就给她造一台大丑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果大丑还不行，那我就给她造一座移动城市，她想用来干什么，就用来干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就这么信任她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为嘉维尔比任何东西都能代表阿卡胡拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我们的主心骨，她也将成为更多人的主心骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我们能做的，就是让嘉维尔的拳头永远不受阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，实际上我也挺担心，真的把阿卡胡拉交给她来管会成什么样子就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以嘉维尔的性格，让她去拥有权力，权力可能会比她还不自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，其实如果她真的来当王酋的话，我是打算给她狠狠培训一段时间的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概不会有效果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我猜也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，连我自己都没想到，我居然愿意为了她做到这一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的经历让你始终对嘉维尔这样的人心存怀疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不否认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，或许你可以试着从相信她开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会尝试一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以说，地图呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......我忘记了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，在你们为了嘉维尔吵得不可开交的时候，只有我这把老骨头和这些机器人在认真寻找着地图。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "并且，我从刚才就发现了，这面书架上的书，和游记根本没有关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我就去了书架的另一面找了找，一下子就找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这个没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿芙朵嘉，笨蛋，阿芙朵嘉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好啦，我知道错啦，对不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样可以了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，阿芙朵嘉，太好了，你还在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶奇大师刚才发来了通讯，他提议现在就在广场举行全体大会，其他代表都已经同意了，问问你的意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我虽然还是没有完全接受，但或许——我确实可以尝试一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克罗绮，告诉耶奇大师，就说，我没有问题，并且，我会来说服际崖城的居民们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
